t way to handle a \"maybe.\"\n3.  **Build a Buffer**: Instead of a fixed return time, build a \"buffer time\" into your trip. If you think you might be late, plan your schedule to be 24-48 hours longer than necessary. This way, if the return slips, you have a small window to adjust without panic.\n4.  **Flexible \"Plan B\"**: If the primary plan (like an outdoor hike) is risky due to weather, have a backup *indoor*"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["no_identified_link"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"no_identified_link","monitor_id":"candidate:e-3adcf4746ebe5f5f0f1a3020","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1"]},"evidence":{"end":160,"quote":"If the weather is uncertain and your return time is flexible, a **flexible and multi-layered approach** usually works best.","source_slot":"s1","start":37},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-3adcf4746ebe5f5f0f1a3020","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-667ca07e1d8e4d7bd422fd05","provenance_group_keys":["external:7f2d3cb1-2bd7-43ff-98bd-b14fbdfb973c"],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1"]},"evidence":{"end":85,"quote":"I am packing for a short trip with uncertain weather and a return time that may slip.","source_slot":"s0","start":0},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-667ca07e1d8e4d7bd422fd05","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"pre